"test":{"name":"grunts-ride-the-apc","kind":"behaviour","opponent":"Human","rounds":"2","check":"combatRide","question":"The winding road again: Blue's two grunts at home with an empty APC beside them (grunts move 3, the APC 6 and takes both); three supply units already carry supply up the road to a tank at the far end of it, the enemy beyond. With rides for fighting units on (combatRides), the APC goes to whoever gains most from it: the first supply unit aboard a vehicle gains more than anyone (it carries supply forward for the whole army), so over two rounds a supply unit rides the APC forward; the grunts walk (or ride along, if there is room).","rules":"attrition"},
